WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.934 --> 00:00:09.889
Aunt Sunny and Tom are very busy.

2
00:00:09.890 --> 00:00:15.236
So we're going to see a movie.

3
00:00:15.237 --> 00:00:18.403
Mom: What movie do you want to see?

4
00:00:18.404 --> 00:00:21.138
Hana: The Unicorn Princess.

5
00:00:21.139 --> 00:00:25.909
Mom: How about The Adventures of Max the Wonder Dog?

6
00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:29.103
Hana & Bada: Okay!

7
00:00:29.104 --> 00:00:32.422
Mom: One adult and two children, please.

8
00:00:32.423 --> 00:00:37.518
Hana: We're going to see The Adventures of Max the Wonder Dog.

9
00:00:37.519 --> 00:00:40.199
Clerk: Okay. Enjoy the show!

10
00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:43.302
Mom: Thank you.

11
00:00:43.303 --> 00:00:45.541
Do you want some popcorn?

12
00:00:45.542 --> 00:00:47.373
Hana & Bada: Yes!

13
00:00:47.374 --> 00:00:50.278
Bada: Can I have some juice too?

14
00:00:50.279 --> 00:00:54.895
Hana: Nothing for me, thanks.

15
00:00:54.896 --> 00:00:57.942
Mommy, where do we sit?

16
00:00:57.943 --> 00:01:00.519
Mom: You can sit wherever you like.

17
00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:01.925
Bada: Really?

18
00:01:01.926 --> 00:01:07.600
Mom: See? There are no seat numbers.

19
00:01:07.601 --> 00:01:11.566
Hana: Bada, can you pass me the popcorn?

20
00:01:11.567 --> 00:01:16.025
Hana: Mommy! Bada won't give me the popcorn.

21
00:01:16.026 --> 00:01:20.166
Mom: Bada!

22
00:01:20.167 --> 00:01:23.765
Voice-over: Meet Max! The wonder dog!

23
00:01:23.766 --> 00:01:26.360
Bada: The movie's starting, Hana!

24
00:01:26.361 --> 00:01:32.164
Hana: I know! Give me the popcorn!

25
00:01:32.165 --> 00:01:34.962
It was a great movie!

26
00:01:34.963 --> 00:01:41.113
Have you seen any good movies lately?
